<title>UK: Kingfisher year profits jump 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher year profits jump 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>52 weeks to February 1</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) basic	41.4		   vs 34.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 14.0		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 19.0		   vs 16.2</p>
<p> Pretax (preexceps)     390.2		 vs 287.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   5,814.8	     vs 5,280.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts forecast pre-tax profits ranged between 376 and 380.1 million pounds.</p>
<p>Full company name - Kingfisher Plc</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
